FROM qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M
# Pin the non-thinking model explicitly. The floating qwen3:4b tag points to
# Thinking-2507 and does not support disabling reasoning through a template.
# 温度、上下文窗口和输出预算共同影响稳定性与性能；temperature 0 不保证绝对确定性，权重量化与 KV Cache 量化应区分。
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_predict 384
